Saphira mail group
===================

Installing this package installs a working Saphira mail server
stack: postfix (MTA), dovecot (MDA/IMAP), rspamd (filtering),
clamav (antivirus with daemon and freshclam updater), and the
saphira-maildragon glue (ported configuration set, management
scripts and schema).

This package carries no payload of its own beyond this file. The
authoritative member list is the `depends` field of this package's
APK metadata (`apk info -a saphira-mail`). Profiles and image
definitions must name the group, never re-enumerate its closure.

(The qmail/vpopmail Toaster stack is a separate, parallel mail
path with its own integration; it is deliberately not a member.)
